Frequency: Per appointment
Volume: ~3–6 foreign executives/directors (family-corporation governance VS-36)
Owner: Immigration Operations Lead / Corporate Secretary
Participants: Corporate Secretary (VS-36), Legal (VS-100.3), Board (VS-36), Tax (VS-79)
