      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4709_Task4" name="For a foreign executive/director/board-officer, secure the appropriate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: For a foreign executive/director/board-officer, secure the appropriate immigration status (often 9G or 47A(2) for government-owned/controlled or special-status, or treaty-based) and ensure alignment with SEC/corporate-governance appointment (VS-36)
Responsible (R): Immigration Operations / Corp Secretary / Legal
Accountable (A): Head of Global Mobility / VP Legal / Board
