Frequency: Continuous + on inspection
Volume: ~ all active foreign workers&#x27; documents
Owner: Immigration Operations Lead
Participants: Compliance (VS-22), Legal (VS-100.3), HR (VS-19), Internal Audit (VS-21), BI, DOLE
