        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Maintain the immigration-document register (AEP, 9G visa, I-Card, SWP, dependent visas) with expiry dates, conditions, and renewal triggers; alert before expiry (compliance calendar W4703)
Responsible (R): Immigration Operations / HRIS
Accountable (A): Head of Global Mobility / VP Legal
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4711_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4711_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
