Responsible (R): Immigration Operations / Legal / Compliance
Accountable (A): Head of Global Mobility / VP Legal
Duration: Per inspection</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4711_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4711_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
