    <bpmn:process id="W_W4712" name="W4712. Foreign-Worker Wage, Minimum-Wage &amp; Anti-Discrimination Compliance (DOLE)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Foreign-worker hire; wage review; DOLE audit
Frequency: Per hire + periodic
Volume: ~15–25 active foreign workers (per W4705)
Owner: Head of Global Mobility / Comp &amp; Benefits
Participants: Comp (VS-102), Payroll (VS-19.2), Legal (VS-100.3), Labor Relations (VS-84), DOLE
Source: workflow W4712 — Foreign-Worker Wage, Minimum-Wage &amp; Anti-Discrimination Compliance (DOLE)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4712_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4712_Lane1" name="Comp">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4712_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4712_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4712_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4712_Lane2" name="Global Mobility">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4712_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4712_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4712_Start4" name="Foreign-worker hire; wage review; DOLE audit">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4712_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4712_Task5" name="Ensure foreign workers receive at least the applicable Philippine regional…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Ensure foreign workers receive at least the applicable Philippine regional minimum wage and statutory benefits (SSS/PhilHealth/Pag-IBIG, 13th-month, leave) per DOLE — foreign workers enjoy the same labor protections; structure compensation per VS-102
Responsible (R): Comp / Global Mobility / Payroll
Accountable (A): Head of Global Mobility / CHRO
Duration: Per hire + periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4712_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4712_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4712_Task6" name="Apply anti-discrimination and equal-treatment principles; manage any DOLE…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Apply anti-discrimination and equal-treatment principles; manage any DOLE concern about foreign-worker displacement of Filipino labor (the AEP justification W4705 addresses this); coordinate with Labor Relations (VS-84)
Responsible (R): Global Mobility / Legal / Labor Relations
Accountable (A): Head of Global Mobility / VP Legal
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4712_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4712_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4712_Task7" name="Retain compensation records (VS-88); support DOLE wage/labor audit; assure via…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Retain compensation records (VS-88); support DOLE wage/labor audit; assure via Internal Audit (VS-21)
Responsible (R): Comp / Payroll / Global Mobility
Accountable (A): Head of Global Mobility / CHRO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4712_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4712_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4712_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4712_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-711 (ensure controlled execution — Immigration, Visa &amp; Foreign-Worker Compliance Operations (PA-160.2).) | - CTL-711: foreign workers paid ≥ minimum wage with full statutory benefits; anti-discrimination applied; AEP justification robust
Owner: Head of Global Mobility / Comp &amp; Benefits</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
